       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FUNCTIONPIE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 RADIUS PIC 9(2)V9 VALUE 2.5.
       01 CIRCLE-AREA PIC 9(3)V9(4).
       01 CIRCUMFERENCE PIC 9(3)V9(4).
       01 E-VALUE PIC 9V9(6).
       01 AREA-EDIT PIC ZZ9.9999.
       01 CIRC-EDIT PIC ZZ9.9999.
       01 E-EDIT PIC 9.999999.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE CIRCLE-AREA = FUNCTION PI * RADIUS * RADIUS
           COMPUTE CIRCUMFERENCE = 2 * FUNCTION PI * RADIUS
           MOVE FUNCTION E TO E-VALUE
           MOVE CIRCLE-AREA TO AREA-EDIT
           MOVE CIRCUMFERENCE TO CIRC-EDIT
           MOVE E-VALUE TO E-EDIT
           DISPLAY "AREA: " AREA-EDIT
           DISPLAY "CIRCUMFERENCE: " CIRC-EDIT
           DISPLAY "E: " E-EDIT
           STOP RUN.
